WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.990 --> 01:31.160
[My Journey to You]

01:31.190 --> 01:34.120
[Episode 13]

02:13.470 --> 02:15.730
A lot of couples are here to admire the lanterns

02:15.730 --> 02:16.900
in pairs.

02:17.480 --> 02:18.650
Exactly.

02:18.990 --> 02:21.070
Your Young Master Yu's eyes

02:21.070 --> 02:22.790
have been stuck on you

02:22.790 --> 02:24.300
like gum.

02:25.130 --> 02:26.710
It's such a beautiful scene.

02:26.710 --> 02:28.150
I should let you two

02:28.329 --> 02:29.590
spend some time alone.

02:32.070 --> 02:32.560
Jin Fan.

02:34.690 --> 02:35.520
It's not safe to be alone.

02:35.520 --> 02:36.920
Go look for Gong Zishang.

02:37.710 --> 02:38.660
How about you?

02:39.810 --> 02:40.410
It's okay.

02:41.360 --> 02:42.160
I won't go far.

02:42.350 --> 02:44.150
Besides, Miss Yun is still here.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.570
After you find Gong Zishang,

02:47.570 --> 02:49.770
go to Housekeeper Jia's house to check.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.400
Let's go.

03:04.880 --> 03:07.380
I went to the pharmacy to get some medicine today.

03:07.380 --> 03:10.340
I made some porridge with the prescription from my hometown.

03:10.340 --> 03:11.740
I don't know why

03:12.310 --> 03:14.440
my chest has been feeling warm lately.

03:29.480 --> 03:31.140
There's miasma in the valley.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.690
It's cold and humid.

03:35.790 --> 03:37.250
You always burn charcoal.

03:39.230 --> 03:41.829
It would cause your chi and blood to be boiling.

03:43.579 --> 03:45.270
So I added some red dates,

03:45.770 --> 03:46.700
glutinous rice,

03:46.900 --> 03:48.500
and dried longan specially.

03:49.060 --> 03:49.910
I thought

03:50.170 --> 03:53.030
it will also present the good omens of a Laba congee.

03:53.560 --> 03:54.560
Young Master Jue,

03:54.680 --> 03:56.140
would you like to try some?

03:57.220 --> 03:59.880
I've been simmering it for the whole afternoon.

04:02.110 --> 04:03.640
Your hands are very steady.

04:06.450 --> 04:08.590
My family practiced medicine for generations.

04:08.590 --> 04:10.650
When I was young, my father trained me

04:10.780 --> 04:11.840
to weigh medicine.

04:12.290 --> 04:13.750
He said my hands must be steady.

04:13.750 --> 04:14.680
I can't tremble.

04:15.830 --> 04:17.290
A milligram difference in

04:17.390 --> 04:18.450
the weight of herbs

04:19.170 --> 04:20.980
could cost someone's life.

05:24.150 --> 05:24.950
Young Master!

05:27.310 --> 05:28.160
This position...

05:28.160 --> 05:29.560
It is the life meridians.

05:29.830 --> 05:30.500
It's so deep.

05:30.500 --> 05:31.330
Can we take it out?

05:31.330 --> 05:32.140
Take it.

05:32.690 --> 05:33.390
Take it out!

05:33.930 --> 05:36.200
Go get the white frost powder to stop the bleeding!

05:36.200 --> 05:36.600
Hurry!

05:36.940 --> 05:38.800
Bring the blood clotting powder!

05:39.100 --> 05:41.040
Get me a wild ginseng.

05:41.470 --> 05:41.990
Quick!

05:46.950 --> 05:47.750
Young Master.

05:48.720 --> 05:50.030
Young Master!

06:36.290 --> 06:36.950
Brother...

06:36.990 --> 06:39.760
The porridge is poisonous...

06:40.960 --> 06:41.760
Be careful...

06:42.260 --> 06:43.190
The porridge...

06:44.409 --> 06:46.890
is... poisonous.

07:24.530 --> 07:26.510
♫The sunset light falls♫

07:26.640 --> 07:29.380
♫A little ink on my heart♫

07:30.080 --> 07:33.840
♫Two ties of grudges becoming into three lives of mistakes♫

07:33.550 --> 07:34.150
And then?

07:35.659 --> 07:37.520
♫The childhood music♫

07:36.350 --> 07:37.480
Are they all folded?

07:37.720 --> 07:40.320
♫Singing about and old friend's song♫

07:38.720 --> 07:39.659
Are they all folded like this?

07:39.659 --> 07:40.190
Lang'er.

07:40.530 --> 07:41.140
Shangjue.

07:40.770 --> 07:45.450
♫What can we do about this guest?♫

07:41.440 --> 07:42.000
Mother.

07:42.310 --> 07:42.830
Mother.

07:43.420 --> 07:44.280
Have a lantern.

07:44.420 --> 07:45.480
Thank you, Mother.

07:46.580 --> 07:49.130
♫Whose song♫

07:48.270 --> 07:48.950
Shangjue.

07:48.950 --> 07:49.950
Play with your brother.

07:49.480 --> 07:51.610
♫Is matching every line?♫

07:50.050 --> 07:50.500
Okay.

07:51.850 --> 07:55.990
♫Fold it gently as the wound spreads♫

07:52.190 --> 07:53.550
I want Brother's.

07:53.550 --> 07:55.610
Brother's dragon lantern is pretty.

07:57.930 --> 08:00.030
♫We share the same hand and feet♫

08:00.440 --> 08:03.020
♫And the same bloodline♫

08:02.440 --> 08:03.240
Do you like it?

08:03.250 --> 08:03.960
Yes.

08:03.340 --> 08:04.310
♫How do we♫

08:04.500 --> 08:07.840
♫Tell the two of us apart♫

08:05.750 --> 08:06.870
Brother is a dragon.

08:06.870 --> 08:08.380
This lantern is also a dragon.

08:08.380 --> 08:10.090
I have two brothers!

08:09.040 --> 08:09.970
♫Brother♫

08:10.140 --> 08:13.770
♫You always laugh at me lightly♫

08:12.430 --> 08:13.110
You

08:13.110 --> 08:13.940
are so greedy.

08:14.400 --> 08:15.790
Isn't it enough to have me as your brother?

08:14.510 --> 08:18.800
♫You teach me not to cry♫

08:16.230 --> 08:18.670
You practice martial arts every day.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.350
You don't play with me much.

08:20.350 --> 08:22.510
This dragon lantern can accompany me.

08:20.410 --> 08:21.250
♫Brother♫

08:21.380 --> 08:24.920
♫You see through the world♫

08:22.630 --> 08:23.830
All right, all right.

08:24.670 --> 08:27.070
But you can't have two younger brothers.

08:25.100 --> 08:27.860
♫But don't understand why♫

08:27.070 --> 08:28.290
You can only have one that is me.

08:28.010 --> 08:30.210
♫I am sad♫

08:28.690 --> 08:29.500
Okay.

08:29.840 --> 08:31.640
You're my only younger brother.

08:50.980 --> 08:51.650
Come out.

08:54.980 --> 08:57.220
♫Whose song♫

08:57.750 --> 08:59.730
♫Is matching every line?♫

08:59.930 --> 09:04.120
♫Fold it gently as the wound spreads♫

09:01.230 --> 09:02.430
You're Gong Yuanzhi,

09:02.830 --> 09:03.380
right?

09:06.390 --> 09:07.230
What are you doing here?

09:06.420 --> 09:08.380
♫We share the same hand and feet♫

09:08.780 --> 09:11.170
♫And the same bloodline♫

09:09.430 --> 09:10.860
My father is dead.

09:11.260 --> 09:13.200
No one will teach me martial arts anymore.

09:11.670 --> 09:12.640
♫How do we♫

09:12.830 --> 09:16.280
♫Tell the two of us apart♫

09:14.110 --> 09:16.070
The bad guys will bully me.

09:32.740 --> 09:33.600
I'll teach you.

09:35.360 --> 09:37.560
Don't teach me anything too difficult.

09:37.580 --> 09:39.110
I'm afraid I can't learn it.

09:39.760 --> 09:41.030
My father hasn't taught me

09:41.030 --> 09:42.830
any of those moves you just made.

09:43.690 --> 09:45.420
It's fine if you can't learn it.

09:45.830 --> 09:46.670
From now on,

09:47.710 --> 09:48.710
I'll protect you.

09:49.580 --> 09:50.240
From now on,

09:51.770 --> 09:53.300
you are my younger brother.

09:54.260 --> 09:55.920
Our fathers are different.

09:56.580 --> 09:58.310
Am I also your younger brother?

10:01.190 --> 10:02.990
As long as your last name is Gong,

10:03.290 --> 10:04.820
you are my younger brother.

10:05.470 --> 10:07.630
Do you have your own younger brother?

10:08.250 --> 10:10.420
Will he be angry if I turn up?

10:18.670 --> 10:20.840
♫Whose song♫

10:21.500 --> 10:23.600
♫Is matching every line?♫

10:23.640 --> 10:28.150
♫Fold it gently as the wound spreads♫

10:30.010 --> 10:31.940
♫We share the same hand and feet♫

10:32.390 --> 10:34.780
♫And the same bloodline♫

10:35.220 --> 10:36.310
♫How do we♫

10:36.530 --> 10:39.870
♫Tell the two of us apart♫

10:41.130 --> 10:42.040
♫Brother♫

10:42.190 --> 10:45.920
♫You always keep your silence♫

10:44.580 --> 10:45.380
My brother...

10:46.190 --> 10:50.890
♫And bear all the bitterness in this world♫

10:48.320 --> 10:49.570
Went somewhere else.

10:51.130 --> 10:52.370
Don't cry.

10:52.480 --> 10:53.290
♫Brother♫

10:53.150 --> 10:54.390
I'll be your younger brother.

10:53.580 --> 10:56.910
♫You call out to me time after time♫

10:57.030 --> 10:59.850
♫Saying we can't♫

11:00.030 --> 11:02.320
♫Be weak♫

11:03.110 --> 11:06.670
♫You said old wounds will always♫

11:07.020 --> 11:08.400
♫Heal♫

11:08.610 --> 11:13.180
♫The old heart needs a new scenery♫

11:14.360 --> 11:17.990
♫You said I can♫

11:18.010 --> 11:19.540
♫Be vulnerable sometimes♫

11:19.550 --> 11:22.240
♫You always have a pair of hands♫

11:22.740 --> 11:25.160
♫To lend me♫

11:33.700 --> 11:34.230
Brother.

11:34.300 --> 11:34.830
Let's go.

11:36.500 --> 11:36.890
Mm.

11:37.630 --> 11:38.160
Let's go.

12:05.840 --> 12:06.770
Where are the lanterns?

12:06.770 --> 12:07.910
Calm down, Young Master.

12:07.910 --> 12:08.630
It might have been

12:08.630 --> 12:10.320
a servant who didn't know better that kept them.

12:10.320 --> 12:11.120
Go look for it.

12:11.310 --> 12:11.740
Yes.

12:18.210 --> 12:18.740
Brother.

12:19.370 --> 12:19.810
Look.

12:20.700 --> 12:22.560
I've fixed all the spoiled parts.

12:23.410 --> 12:25.270
Who allowed you to act on your own?

12:28.350 --> 12:28.770
I...

12:30.050 --> 12:32.380
I thought the lantern looked a little old.

12:33.130 --> 12:33.870
So I...

12:33.910 --> 12:37.110
Do you think a new one will always be better than an old one?

12:46.970 --> 12:47.900
You leave first.

13:05.590 --> 13:06.720
Young Master Yuanzhi.

13:06.720 --> 13:07.450
The sun is up.

13:07.970 --> 13:08.900
Go back and rest.

13:12.630 --> 13:14.960
The stain on the tail of the dragon lantern

13:15.400 --> 13:17.600
was caused by the ink from the first time

13:17.770 --> 13:19.300
Lang learnt to write poems.

13:20.950 --> 13:22.480
The broken dragon whiskers

13:23.650 --> 13:25.450
were broken by Lang's tight grip

13:26.130 --> 13:27.860
when he was having a nightmare.

13:30.110 --> 13:31.370
To Young Master Jue,

13:32.630 --> 13:34.490
these are all traces left by Lang.

13:35.480 --> 13:37.210
They're the only memoirs left.

13:39.720 --> 13:40.320
I know now.

13:45.990 --> 13:47.920
I won't repair the old one anymore.

13:51.060 --> 13:51.570
Keep it.

13:55.450 --> 13:56.330
I'll...

13:58.930 --> 14:00.560
make a new one for Brother.

14:02.410 --> 14:03.740
New clothes are better.

14:04.350 --> 14:05.250
But not people.

14:06.590 --> 14:07.850
Young Master Yuanzhi,

14:08.390 --> 14:09.920
please try and understand.

14:16.680 --> 14:17.290
But I...

14:21.000 --> 14:22.310
But I'm not clothes.

15:00.590 --> 15:02.190
What's wrong with your hand?

15:03.750 --> 15:04.790
When I was making herbs,

15:04.790 --> 15:06.750
I got cut by the dry hard herbs.

15:07.030 --> 15:07.670
It's minor.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.210
I’m fine.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.050
Miss Shangguan.

16:04.300 --> 16:05.700
I’m here to see Young Master Shangjue.

16:05.700 --> 16:06.900
He went to the clinic.

16:07.340 --> 16:08.070
I'll go to the clinic then–

16:08.070 --> 16:09.000
He said he'd like

16:09.660 --> 16:11.320
no one to disturb him tonight.

16:37.610 --> 16:38.410
Young Master.

16:39.610 --> 16:42.450
You've transferred so much internal skill to Young Master Yuanzhi.

16:42.450 --> 16:43.400
Can you take it?

16:47.990 --> 16:48.790
I'm fine.

16:49.880 --> 16:51.140
You're looking for me?

16:51.610 --> 16:52.740
The guards reported

16:52.890 --> 16:55.290
that Gong Ziyu has left the Gong residence.

16:55.670 --> 16:56.780
Flowery lights

16:57.060 --> 16:58.460
and beautiful sceneries

16:59.140 --> 17:01.110
are nothing to him.

17:01.470 --> 17:02.170
But

17:02.510 --> 17:04.630
he's with three other people this time.

17:04.630 --> 17:05.349
Among them,

17:06.020 --> 17:08.079
there's also the bride, Yun Weishan.

17:14.780 --> 17:16.640
Send someone to keep an eye on her.

17:16.750 --> 17:17.990
To keep an eye on Gong Ziyu?

17:17.990 --> 17:19.589
To keep an eye on Yun Weishan.

17:21.869 --> 17:23.220
If I'm right,

17:23.800 --> 17:26.130
that invisible net will be reeled up soon.

17:27.319 --> 17:28.170
I can't leave.

17:28.640 --> 17:30.300
Go make arrangements quickly.

17:30.300 --> 17:30.830
Brother.

17:33.500 --> 17:33.990
Go.

17:34.860 --> 17:35.610
I'm fine.

17:37.130 --> 17:38.460
Go to the Yu Lineage now.

17:39.390 --> 17:40.720
Wait for them to return,

17:41.060 --> 17:42.790
and confront them right there.

17:44.820 --> 17:46.820
Otherwise, they will deny it again.

17:50.190 --> 17:52.080
Send someone to protect the clinic.

17:52.080 --> 17:53.410
Without my permission,

17:53.530 --> 17:54.930
no one can enter or leave.

17:55.590 --> 17:56.070
Yes.

17:58.000 --> 17:58.530
Brother.

17:59.750 --> 18:00.750
That porridge...

18:01.750 --> 18:03.580
That porridge was not poisonous.

18:03.580 --> 18:04.380
I've checked.

18:07.250 --> 18:08.220
Have a good rest.

18:08.980 --> 18:10.180
If there's anything,

18:10.220 --> 18:11.870
call for me with the whistling arrow.

18:11.870 --> 18:12.600
Don't worry.

18:12.840 --> 18:13.370
Brother.

18:37.630 --> 18:38.300
Miss Yun.

18:38.860 --> 18:40.980
This rabbit lantern is quite cute.

18:50.380 --> 18:51.110
Miss Yun?

18:58.910 --> 18:59.710
Do you like it?

18:59.750 --> 19:01.680
If you like it, I will buy it for you.

19:01.920 --> 19:03.110
Sorry, sir.

19:03.330 --> 19:04.280
Our lantern

19:04.510 --> 19:05.200
is a prize.

19:05.440 --> 19:06.640
You can't just buy it.

19:06.780 --> 19:07.950
If you like it,

19:08.210 --> 19:09.280
you can solve the lantern riddles.

19:09.280 --> 19:10.680
If you solve three riddles right,

19:10.680 --> 19:11.810
you can take it away.

19:12.500 --> 19:13.900
Solving lantern riddle?

19:14.670 --> 19:15.390
Miss Yun.

19:16.100 --> 19:18.360
Do you know how to solve lantern riddles?

20:01.740 --> 20:03.000
It came from the valley

20:03.870 --> 20:05.270
and moved to a tree.

20:18.820 --> 20:20.500
When it's young, it wears green.

20:20.500 --> 20:22.230
When it's old, it wears yellow.

20:25.030 --> 20:25.720
I know this.

20:26.200 --> 20:26.930
It's banana.

20:33.630 --> 20:34.690
Second Young Miss.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.060
Second Young Miss.

20:39.740 --> 20:42.000
I know Eldest Young Miss is Gong Zishang.

20:42.750 --> 20:45.410
But I have no clue about the Second Young Miss...

20:46.840 --> 20:48.250
The second-in-line of the Gong Family

20:48.250 --> 20:51.050
is a man who wears nothing but a cold face everyday.

20:53.360 --> 20:53.950
Poise.

20:56.180 --> 20:57.140
Posture, poise.

21:00.230 --> 21:03.290
It's made up of the words that means "second daughter."

21:06.250 --> 21:07.180
You're amazing.

21:08.250 --> 21:09.110
Solve one then.

21:12.900 --> 21:14.390
It's been a long drought with no rain,

21:14.390 --> 21:15.650
only thunder is heard.

21:16.260 --> 21:16.990
Guess a word.

21:17.490 --> 21:18.010
Field.

21:20.490 --> 21:23.350
There's only thunder but no rain. It has to be field.

21:27.340 --> 21:28.380
You're so smart?

21:29.750 --> 21:31.280
Why didn't you say anything just now?

21:31.280 --> 21:32.830
You wanted to see me make a fool of myself?

21:32.830 --> 21:35.620
They all say the Sword Wielder doesn't like studying.

21:35.620 --> 21:37.750
I wanted to see if the rumors were true.

21:40.920 --> 21:42.170
Please be careful with

21:42.170 --> 21:44.150
how you talk to the Sword Wielder.

21:45.960 --> 21:47.420
Understood, the Sword Wielder.

21:47.420 --> 21:48.680
I know my mistake.

21:52.930 --> 21:53.620
In the past,

21:54.170 --> 21:56.770
I often solved riddles with my younger sister.

21:57.720 --> 21:58.950
My younger sister would give the question,

21:58.950 --> 22:00.010
and I'll answer it.

22:01.190 --> 22:02.130
As time passed,

22:02.710 --> 22:04.400
I understood the key to it.

22:05.400 --> 22:06.860
You have a younger sister?

22:07.060 --> 22:09.060
I've never heard you talk about her.

22:09.720 --> 22:10.380
Godsister.

22:11.350 --> 22:13.080
I've told you about her before.

22:15.210 --> 22:17.140
The one who'd sing for you at night?

22:37.620 --> 22:39.760
I only hope that the one I love

22:40.280 --> 22:43.050
can understand the light in my hand.

22:44.060 --> 22:44.790
Speechless.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.260
Annoying!

22:53.260 --> 22:54.360
So many lanterns.

22:55.170 --> 22:55.760
What?

22:55.790 --> 22:56.920
Stealing lanterns?

22:57.540 --> 22:58.540
Buying lanterns.

23:00.430 --> 23:02.700
I want the brightest lantern here

23:02.920 --> 23:05.240
that'd stand out the most in the crowd.

23:05.530 --> 23:06.170
Do you have any?

23:06.170 --> 23:08.500
You must be on a date with someone you like.

23:09.260 --> 23:10.470
Look at this delicate jade rabbit.

23:10.470 --> 23:11.980
Many girls like it.

23:12.400 --> 23:13.380
Delicate?

23:14.010 --> 23:14.870
I don't like it.

23:15.430 --> 23:15.930
Wait.

23:17.150 --> 23:18.470
I have a tough one.

23:19.030 --> 23:20.580
You must like it.

23:25.350 --> 23:26.910
This colorful phoenix lantern

23:26.910 --> 23:28.260
is bigger and brighter.

23:28.710 --> 23:29.390
But

23:29.410 --> 23:30.470
it's too heavy.

23:30.490 --> 23:31.790
Ordinary girls...

23:33.510 --> 23:34.340
can't lift it.

23:37.190 --> 23:39.370
You are quite something.

23:39.590 --> 23:40.230
Quite,

23:40.230 --> 23:41.240
but not too much.

23:42.020 --> 23:44.180
Is this lantern bright enough?

23:44.570 --> 23:46.230
There are so many people here.

23:46.840 --> 23:49.020
What if my lover can't see it?

23:49.710 --> 23:50.910
What should I do then?

23:51.290 --> 23:53.380
Is your lover old?

23:53.630 --> 23:55.060
Does he have a bad eyesight?

23:55.060 --> 23:55.900
Stop it.

23:56.190 --> 23:57.170
I'll buy

23:57.750 --> 23:58.750
this entire cart.

23:59.990 --> 24:00.560
Miss,

24:00.720 --> 24:02.830
you are more beautiful than a fairy.

24:02.960 --> 24:03.520
Deal.

24:03.670 --> 24:04.870
Deal.

24:06.350 --> 24:07.990
But this cart is a bit heavy.

24:07.990 --> 24:10.250
Isn't it too much for you to push it alone?

24:10.500 --> 24:11.340
No.

24:12.030 --> 24:14.270
I purposely lost him in the crowd

24:14.610 --> 24:16.010
to get him to come find me.

24:16.040 --> 24:19.150
If he could still find me among this crowd,

24:19.430 --> 24:23.990
then we are fated to be.

24:24.670 --> 24:25.220
Miss,

24:25.340 --> 24:27.200
if you buy my entire lantern cart,

24:27.390 --> 24:29.170
isn't that cheating?

24:29.310 --> 24:30.230
In this way,

24:30.470 --> 24:32.200
aren't you going to win easily?

24:32.240 --> 24:33.320
As the saying goes,

24:33.430 --> 24:35.490
with a calm mind can I win more easily.

24:36.390 --> 24:37.790
Everything else is fine.

24:37.840 --> 24:38.970
But what about fate?

24:38.990 --> 24:42.320
As long as your hearts are connected, it will naturally be a long-lasting love.

24:42.320 --> 24:44.180
You don't have to be too stubborn.

24:44.950 --> 24:46.480
I insist on being stubborn.

24:46.890 --> 24:47.490
All right.

24:47.750 --> 24:48.680
Good luck to you.

24:54.740 --> 24:56.920
Be it manmade, or natural fate,

24:58.930 --> 25:00.570
I want all these fates.

25:14.790 --> 25:16.800
Jin Fan!

25:16.820 --> 25:19.700
Come quickly!

25:26.110 --> 25:27.870
Jin Fan.

25:28.270 --> 25:30.040
Come quickly.

25:32.380 --> 25:33.660
Watch out for the fire.

25:38.460 --> 25:40.860
Look, that man is holding a rabbit lantern.

25:42.550 --> 25:45.230
Young Master, let me take the rabbit lamp.

25:46.000 --> 25:46.650
No.

25:47.060 --> 25:48.320
This is a gift from you.

25:50.270 --> 25:52.070
You paid for the lantern riddle.

25:52.470 --> 25:54.670
It can't be considered as a gift from me.

25:54.830 --> 25:57.030
Some things can't be bought with money.

25:57.150 --> 25:57.640
Sir,

25:58.050 --> 25:59.550
Miss, do you want to make a braid?

25:59.550 --> 26:01.750
Love braids can ensure fulfilling love

26:01.910 --> 26:03.440
and a harmonious marriage.

26:06.300 --> 26:06.680
Sure.

26:07.220 --> 26:09.280
I'll just buy something for you then.

26:16.340 --> 26:16.860
Sir,

26:17.270 --> 26:18.930
take as much as you need for the braiding.

26:18.930 --> 26:20.380
I think this lady here has a thin wrist.

26:20.380 --> 26:21.780
You don't need that much.

26:22.230 --> 26:23.420
I accidentally pulled too much.

26:23.420 --> 26:24.440
I will make two then.

26:24.440 --> 26:24.830
Okay.

26:26.630 --> 26:27.350
Sir,

26:27.600 --> 26:29.000
this is a bit deliberate.

26:29.200 --> 26:31.280
Haven't you been trained to lie?

26:32.800 --> 26:34.250
Who will train to lie?

26:42.390 --> 26:42.820
Sir.

26:46.550 --> 26:47.150
Your hand.

27:01.830 --> 27:02.690
Put it on for me.

27:04.580 --> 27:05.950
This is for girls.

27:07.190 --> 27:09.620
They said this will ensure fulfilling love and a harmonious marriage.

27:09.620 --> 27:11.750
How can the girl wear it but not the man?

28:50.180 --> 28:52.740
♫Sighing at the lights and song♫

28:52.760 --> 28:54.870
♫Weaving the world's lights♫

28:54.900 --> 28:56.040
♫Sigh at the beautiful scenery♫

28:56.040 --> 28:58.120
♫Who will enjoy it with me?♫

28:58.250 --> 29:00.350
♫Where the lights fall upon♫

29:00.800 --> 29:02.530
♫People come♫

29:02.860 --> 29:05.540
♫And people go♫

29:08.220 --> 29:10.450
♫You and I look♫

29:10.480 --> 29:12.580
♫At the long galaxy between us♫

29:12.610 --> 29:13.760
♫What can we do?♫

29:13.780 --> 29:15.880
♫Flowers fall with the rain♫

29:15.910 --> 29:18.270
♫The wind doesn't ask the clouds♫

29:18.540 --> 29:20.150
♫The clouds♫

29:20.730 --> 29:22.830
♫Don't speak too♫

29:24.860 --> 29:27.010
♫I'm waiting for the wind without pain♫

29:27.010 --> 29:29.830
♫Waiting for when I can't stand how much I miss you to get drunk♫

29:29.830 --> 29:31.610
♫Waiting for the snow to not be lost♫

29:31.610 --> 29:34.180
♫Waiting for the cold to leave and when everything grows♫

29:34.180 --> 29:36.180
♫Waiting for the moon in the poem♫

29:36.200 --> 29:38.640
♫To make a bottle of forever and ever♫

29:38.780 --> 29:40.560
♫Taste all the warmth♫

29:40.590 --> 29:42.470
♫And let's talk about leaving for somewhere far♫

29:42.470 --> 29:44.830
♫I'm waiting for my beloved to return home♫

29:44.830 --> 29:47.600
♫Waiting for the rainy night lit by the red candles by the west window♫

29:47.600 --> 29:49.440
♫Waiting for the leaves to fall and the white snow♫

29:49.440 --> 29:52.010
♫Write the story on the thick snow♫

29:52.030 --> 29:53.840
♫Waiting for our story♫

29:53.870 --> 29:56.580
♫To be spread everywhere by the wind♫

29:56.600 --> 29:59.330
♫Ferment all the longing♫

29:59.360 --> 30:03.770
♫Cherish all the past♫

30:00.630 --> 30:01.170
Miss.

30:02.220 --> 30:04.150
Is the person you like not here yet?

30:05.710 --> 30:06.570
They will come.

30:07.510 --> 30:08.230
Good luck.

30:18.910 --> 30:19.470
Jin–

30:19.870 --> 30:22.300
Why do you look so lonely?

30:22.430 --> 30:24.250
Did you get separated?

30:24.890 --> 30:25.650
How about

30:25.800 --> 30:27.230
enjoying the lanterns with us?

30:27.230 --> 30:27.750
Yes.

30:27.930 --> 30:28.310
Come.

30:28.330 --> 30:29.700
Let's enjoy the lanterns together.

30:29.700 --> 30:30.350
What are you doing?

30:30.350 --> 30:31.110
Let's go see the lanterns together.

30:31.110 --> 30:31.510
Let go!

30:32.320 --> 30:32.730
Let go!

30:35.220 --> 30:35.920
Jin Fan...

30:39.300 --> 30:40.730
You finally found me.

30:41.670 --> 30:42.240
Well...

30:42.520 --> 30:44.050
How does that poem go again?

30:44.930 --> 30:46.260
Something marriage...

30:46.470 --> 30:48.040
Something lights.

30:57.750 --> 30:58.610
This is for you.

30:59.680 --> 31:01.140
But this lantern is small.

31:03.050 --> 31:04.390
You probably like big ones.

31:04.390 --> 31:05.230
No.

31:05.370 --> 31:06.830
Small ones are cute.

31:08.250 --> 31:09.480
Fireflies?

31:10.270 --> 31:11.730
You caught them yourself?

31:12.460 --> 31:14.970
When did you prepare a gift for me?

31:17.080 --> 31:17.890
It's sold over there.

31:17.890 --> 31:19.290
Ten copper coins for one.

31:20.730 --> 31:22.410
You don't mean what you say.

31:27.510 --> 31:28.950
I'm going to raise them,

31:28.950 --> 31:30.480
and name them.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.430
Fireflies can only live for three to five days.

31:33.430 --> 31:34.160
I don't care.

31:34.370 --> 31:36.590
I will put them in the valley of the Gong Residence

31:36.590 --> 31:38.780
so that they can continue to reproduce.

31:38.780 --> 31:39.990
The insects multiply

31:40.230 --> 31:41.440
and go on for

31:41.630 --> 31:43.080
endless generations.

31:43.220 --> 31:43.990
Only male bugs

31:43.990 --> 31:45.010
glow, no?

31:47.050 --> 31:49.380
Bad apples fall from rotten trees.

31:49.690 --> 31:52.010
Gong Ziyu doesn't study and so don't you.

31:52.870 --> 31:56.630
All fireflies, regardless of gender, glow.

31:58.780 --> 32:00.620
What should I name it?

32:01.140 --> 32:04.960
Why don't we use your surname and my name?

32:06.330 --> 32:09.080
Let's call it Little Jin Zi.

32:12.260 --> 32:14.070
Little Jin Shang might sound better...

32:14.070 --> 32:14.480
Sure.

32:14.670 --> 32:17.530
Naming is something important. I'll listen to you.

32:18.460 --> 32:21.920
You just said there are pottery and candied haws here.

32:22.560 --> 32:24.460
Did you inquire about these

32:24.560 --> 32:28.800
because you thought about going around this lantern festival with me hand in hand?

32:28.800 --> 32:29.390
No.

32:29.750 --> 32:30.950
I'm a dog if I'm lying.

32:30.990 --> 32:32.940
You'd rather be a dog than admit it.

32:32.970 --> 32:34.980
Young Master, I didn't lie to you.

32:35.070 --> 32:37.090
I told you the person you like would like it

32:37.090 --> 32:38.480
if you gifted it to them.

32:42.150 --> 32:42.990
He forced me into

32:42.990 --> 32:44.010
buying it from him

32:44.210 --> 32:45.110
and refused to let me leave,

32:45.110 --> 32:46.210
so I bought one.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.920
Sir,

32:48.030 --> 32:50.020
that's not what you said. You said–

32:50.020 --> 32:51.230
What did he say?

32:51.230 --> 32:53.500
He said this lantern can't be blown out by the wind.

32:53.500 --> 32:54.490
It's good.

32:54.940 --> 32:55.770
How sweet.

32:56.780 --> 32:59.100
Don't rush to meet up with Gong Ziyu.

32:59.180 --> 33:00.220
Let the couple

33:00.250 --> 33:02.040
spend more time together.

33:02.590 --> 33:04.210
I'm not looking to meet up with him,

33:04.210 --> 33:06.610
but the Sword Wielder gave us two a mission.

33:07.100 --> 33:08.510
So exciting?

33:20.390 --> 33:22.450
Gong Zishang sneaked out for so long.

33:23.300 --> 33:24.630
I feel sorry for Jin Fan.

33:25.180 --> 33:26.910
I thought you wouldn't notice.

33:27.700 --> 33:29.630
I can see through her little trick.

33:30.460 --> 33:32.310
But you still helped her.

33:33.460 --> 33:34.640
I have my own ideas.

33:35.870 --> 33:37.400
What are you talking about?

33:37.760 --> 33:38.360
Nothing.

33:46.970 --> 33:47.770
What's wrong?

33:48.480 --> 33:48.980
Oh no!

33:49.230 --> 33:49.960
My necklace!

33:50.260 --> 33:51.760
My sister's ring is on it.

33:53.230 --> 33:53.830
Take this.

33:53.910 --> 33:54.570
Wait for me.

34:22.219 --> 34:23.679
Please spare my life!

34:28.630 --> 34:29.690
Today is a good day.

34:29.710 --> 34:31.310
I don't want to ruin the mood.

34:31.550 --> 34:31.940
Scram.

34:31.940 --> 34:33.150
Thank you, sir.

35:19.790 --> 35:20.650
Is anyone here?

35:27.520 --> 35:29.380
Where did you get the mirror from?

35:29.570 --> 35:30.900
Mind your own business.

35:31.070 --> 35:31.530
Okay.

35:41.760 --> 35:42.400
Miss Yun.

35:44.620 --> 35:45.330
Miss Yun!

35:53.270 --> 35:55.000
Are you here for Old Man Jia too?

35:55.670 --> 35:57.400
What happened to him?

35:57.980 --> 36:00.510
People keep coming to look for him these days.

36:01.150 --> 36:02.040
Who else came?

36:02.860 --> 36:03.660
A few days ago,

36:04.210 --> 36:05.360
a rough and tough guy

36:05.470 --> 36:07.020
with a fierce face came too.

36:07.720 --> 36:09.520
What happened to Old Man Jia?

36:11.680 --> 36:12.530
It's nothing.

36:12.950 --> 36:16.280
What can happen to him when he works in the Gong Residence?

36:20.250 --> 36:23.180
We are Jia's distant relatives.

36:23.350 --> 36:25.510
We came to visit him since it's the festival.

36:25.510 --> 36:26.950
But he's not here.

36:26.980 --> 36:27.910
Tell me about it.

36:29.500 --> 36:29.910
He

36:30.510 --> 36:31.800
is my husband.

36:32.230 --> 36:33.630
He's not good at talking.

36:33.790 --> 36:35.050
Please don't mind him.

37:11.800 --> 37:14.830
[Wanhua Pavillion]

37:45.110 --> 37:45.970
Sword Wielder.

37:48.910 --> 37:50.510
You call me the Sword Wielder

37:50.800 --> 37:52.800
but you don't listen to my commands.

37:53.070 --> 37:53.950
We will do everything

37:53.950 --> 37:54.700
you order.

37:55.830 --> 37:57.390
I didn't ask you to come,

37:57.570 --> 37:58.540
but you came.

37:59.230 --> 38:00.690
Who ordered you to do this?

38:01.510 --> 38:03.500
I want to protect you.

38:03.580 --> 38:05.110
Do you want to protect me...

38:05.590 --> 38:06.490
or spy on me?

38:07.260 --> 38:08.140
I dare not.

38:09.180 --> 38:09.610
Stop!

38:13.230 --> 38:14.360
Where are you going?

38:14.660 --> 38:17.060
Are you going back to report to your master?

38:17.410 --> 38:19.020
You're not allowed to go anywhere.

38:19.020 --> 38:19.950
Wait for me here.

39:26.940 --> 39:27.980
You are Ziyi?

39:38.470 --> 39:39.700
I won’t drink the tea.

39:41.650 --> 39:43.000
I'm not here for tea.

39:46.160 --> 39:48.000
And tea is not only for drinking.

39:49.140 --> 39:49.780
Leave it.

39:50.780 --> 39:52.510
It's good to just look at it too.

39:57.030 --> 39:58.020
She's also a Chi?

40:04.260 --> 40:04.660
A Mei?

40:09.080 --> 40:09.990
Is she...

40:13.310 --> 40:13.850
a Wang?

40:18.310 --> 40:19.910
But there are only four Wangs

40:20.550 --> 40:21.720
in Wufeng.

40:23.660 --> 40:25.260
I've never seen them before.

40:26.020 --> 40:26.900
Stop guessing.

40:27.940 --> 40:28.880
I am nobody.

40:31.180 --> 40:33.380
I'm just helping Han Yasi.

40:34.000 --> 40:35.460
You must have an identity.

40:36.300 --> 40:37.880
But I have no right to know.

40:39.380 --> 40:40.180
I won't guess.

40:41.650 --> 40:42.430
I'm here

40:43.510 --> 40:46.040
to get the antidote for Shangguan Qian and me.

40:46.950 --> 40:49.210
Why didn't Shangguan Qian come herself?

40:49.930 --> 40:50.930
She can't get out.

40:52.460 --> 40:53.720
She trusts you so much.

40:54.700 --> 40:55.580
Not bad.

40:58.510 --> 41:01.030
The young generation is really different.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.810
Did you bring the thing?

41:12.210 --> 41:13.010
The antidote.

41:29.600 --> 41:30.840
Young Master Ziyu.

41:32.230 --> 41:33.470
It's been a long time.

41:35.740 --> 41:37.330
Young Master Ziyu.

41:37.440 --> 41:38.640
It's been a long time.

41:38.890 --> 41:39.850
But unfortunately,

41:39.850 --> 41:41.150
Ziyi has guests today.

41:41.170 --> 41:42.370
Did you see

41:42.460 --> 41:45.380
a young and beautiful female guest entering just now?

41:45.380 --> 41:46.150
Come on.

41:46.150 --> 41:47.630
Are you kidding?

41:47.630 --> 41:49.780
Why would a female guest come here?

41:50.110 --> 41:51.190
Let me get you some–

41:51.310 --> 41:52.370
Did you really not?

41:52.540 --> 41:53.690
No.

41:54.520 --> 41:54.920
Fine.

41:55.000 --> 41:57.290
I'll take take a look myself. You get back to work.

41:57.290 --> 41:59.690
Come here often.

41:59.950 --> 42:01.130
You should.

42:01.510 --> 42:02.340
Come often.

42:02.950 --> 42:03.880
Come more often.

42:05.870 --> 42:07.400
Does Miss Ziyi have a guest?

42:07.790 --> 42:09.030
No.

42:09.030 --> 42:09.590
I just passed by.

42:09.590 --> 42:12.120
The pattern hung out on her door is still a Bud.

42:14.560 --> 42:16.090
Within the Gong Residence,

42:16.410 --> 42:18.140
besides Shangguan Qian and me,

42:19.040 --> 42:20.900
is there anyone else from Wufeng?

42:35.290 --> 42:35.690
Wait.

42:38.430 --> 42:39.910
The charcoal has been burning for too long.

42:39.910 --> 42:42.170
Let me open the window for some fresh air.

42:42.670 --> 42:43.790
You can't leave through the window.

42:43.790 --> 42:44.450
Hide first.

43:06.760 --> 43:08.020
Do you know each other?

43:09.910 --> 43:10.830
Of course not.

43:16.520 --> 43:17.580
You know Miss Ziyi?

43:19.360 --> 43:21.280
The tea is not only for drinking.

43:24.310 --> 43:25.050
Leave it.

43:25.680 --> 43:27.210
It's good to just look at it.

43:29.950 --> 43:30.850
This signal

43:33.740 --> 43:34.670
means to attack.

43:40.180 --> 43:41.030
This signal

43:42.670 --> 43:43.670
means to retreat.

43:56.990 --> 43:57.760
Miss Ziyi.

43:58.350 --> 44:00.610
Someone told me you have a guest just now.

44:01.750 --> 44:02.810
I didn't expect...

44:03.000 --> 44:03.910
it's Miss Yun.

44:15.180 --> 44:15.980
That's right.

44:17.190 --> 44:18.490
I'm Miss Ziyi's

44:19.680 --> 44:20.430
guest.

44:22.530 --> 44:23.140
Miss Yun.

44:23.900 --> 44:24.500
I...

44:26.070 --> 44:26.530
This...

44:27.150 --> 44:28.950
I heard from Sister Zishang that

44:29.420 --> 44:31.220
you often leave Gong Residence

44:31.960 --> 44:34.010
to come here the most.

44:35.270 --> 44:37.800
Even when the former Sword Wielder was angry,

44:38.670 --> 44:41.600
he couldn't stop you from coming to visit one person.

44:44.350 --> 44:45.550
I was really curious,

44:46.330 --> 44:47.350
so I came to see.

44:49.260 --> 44:49.920
I thought

44:50.750 --> 44:52.490
she must know more than me.

44:54.140 --> 44:55.540
I want to know you better.

44:59.580 --> 45:00.910
So I came here...

45:02.020 --> 45:02.850
alone.

45:10.060 --> 45:10.660
Yes.

45:11.390 --> 45:13.190
I was surprised when I heard that

45:13.510 --> 45:15.420
there was a female guest looking for me.

45:15.420 --> 45:17.150
Later, I heard the servants say

45:17.590 --> 45:19.200
it's the lady that Young Master Gong Ziyu

45:19.200 --> 45:21.380
was walking around the lantern market with,

45:21.380 --> 45:22.440
and figured it out.

45:24.580 --> 45:26.640
That's why I invited her here

45:27.530 --> 45:28.420
to have some tea

45:29.580 --> 45:32.980
and talk about what you usually do when you come to look for me.

45:33.640 --> 45:34.840
I didn't do anything.

45:35.750 --> 45:36.680
Are you nervous?

45:38.610 --> 45:39.580
This is the first time

45:39.580 --> 45:41.100
I'm seeing you so nervous.

45:42.310 --> 45:43.300
But don't worry.

45:44.150 --> 45:45.680
I won't give her a hard time.

45:46.950 --> 45:48.610
In fact, even before you came,

45:48.950 --> 45:50.950
we were having a good time chatting.

45:51.780 --> 45:53.150
Am I right, Miss Yun?

46:00.470 --> 46:01.380
Miss Ziyi

46:02.280 --> 46:04.230
told me a lot about your past.

46:07.710 --> 46:09.790
There are not many things between us.

46:10.390 --> 46:11.110
Yes.

46:12.410 --> 46:14.070
That's all we have between us.

46:17.080 --> 46:17.680
All right.

46:18.990 --> 46:20.550
This is not the best place

46:21.160 --> 46:23.760
for Miss Yun to stay around for too long.

46:24.410 --> 46:26.410
Please take her back, Young Master.

46:40.080 --> 46:41.410
My tea is cold.

46:42.470 --> 46:43.790
I won't keep you.

47:05.180 --> 47:05.920
Let's go.

47:09.740 --> 47:11.940
There's something I haven't taken yet.

47:47.840 --> 47:48.420
Blood...

48:27.700 --> 48:32.260
[The murderer is Anonymous. The sharpest saber has no blade.]

48:35.580 --> 48:36.070
Who?

48:45.610 --> 48:46.270
Who are you?

48:46.470 --> 48:48.750
There is no woman with martial skills like you in the Gong family.

48:48.750 --> 48:49.550
What should we do?

48:49.550 --> 48:50.610
Do we keep waiting?

48:50.630 --> 48:51.960
Yun Weishan is missing.

48:52.830 --> 48:53.750
We can't keep waiting.

48:53.750 --> 48:54.750
Shoot the whistling arrows.

48:54.750 --> 48:55.770
Notify Young Master Shangjue that

48:55.770 --> 48:57.390
the bride is suspected to have escaped.

48:57.390 --> 48:58.700
Ask if they would like to order the guards

48:58.700 --> 49:00.100
to search the whole city.

49:03.310 --> 49:03.720
Oh no!

49:03.940 --> 49:04.710
Something happened.

49:04.710 --> 49:05.860
Go look for the Sword Wielder.

49:05.860 --> 49:06.720
Gosh. Goodbye.

49:06.720 --> 49:07.920
Let's talk next time!

49:32.370 --> 49:33.500
Who's there?

49:38.550 --> 49:39.610
What are you doing?

49:41.430 --> 49:42.310
I thought

49:42.330 --> 49:43.560
Miss Yun has escaped.

49:43.900 --> 49:44.530
Escaped?

49:44.890 --> 49:45.540
No.

49:45.760 --> 49:46.310
I mean...

49:46.330 --> 49:46.790
Lost...

49:47.030 --> 49:47.830
Lost your way.

50:20.270 --> 50:21.110
Sword Wielder.

50:21.110 --> 50:22.590
Go to the Council of Elders.

50:22.590 --> 50:23.450
What happened?

50:23.450 --> 50:24.060
Report,

50:24.380 --> 50:25.440
Lady Wuji was attacked.

50:25.440 --> 50:27.210
She has been sent to the clinic for emergency treatment.

50:27.210 --> 50:28.380
The Anonymous Murderer

50:28.380 --> 50:29.510
has appeared again.

50:33.140 --> 50:33.680
Jin Fan,

50:34.200 --> 50:36.510
escort Yun Weishan back to the Yu Lineage first.

50:36.510 --> 50:37.440
Sister Zishang,

50:37.610 --> 50:39.810
go to the clinic to visit the Concubine.

50:40.180 --> 50:42.310
I'm going to the Council of Elders now.

50:57.510 --> 50:58.110
You two

50:58.250 --> 50:59.140
go check over there.

50:59.140 --> 50:59.630
Yes!

51:01.990 --> 51:03.390
Search carefully!

51:05.750 --> 51:06.610
What happened?

51:07.460 --> 51:09.190
Elder Hua ordered for a search.

51:09.790 --> 51:11.120
The Sword Wielder has gone to the Council of Elders.

51:11.120 --> 51:11.970
Eldest Young Miss

51:11.970 --> 51:13.900
went to the clinic to see Lady Wuji.

51:13.930 --> 51:15.590
What we are looking for is any females among the different lineages

51:15.590 --> 51:17.190
for any injuries sustained.

51:17.670 --> 51:19.500
Why are you looking for a wounded woman?

51:19.500 --> 51:20.830
We're just following orders.

51:20.830 --> 51:21.770
As for the reason,

51:21.770 --> 51:22.970
please ask Elder Hua.

51:52.930 --> 51:54.130
Miss Shangguan Qian.

52:02.650 --> 52:04.260
[Jue]

52:05.920 --> 52:07.120
Miss Shangguan Qian.

52:19.490 --> 52:20.410
Young Master Shangjue.

52:20.410 --> 52:21.210
What’s wrong?

52:21.550 --> 52:23.010
Elder Hua has made an order

52:23.070 --> 52:25.720
to search the various lineages to see if there are any injured women.

52:25.720 --> 52:28.120
Please ask Shangguan Qian to open the door.

52:29.940 --> 52:30.540
All right.

52:33.610 --> 52:34.810
Miss Shangguan Qian.

52:37.410 --> 52:38.610
Miss Shangguan Qian.

52:41.300 --> 52:42.160
Break the door.

52:45.420 --> 52:46.750
Young Master Shangjue?

52:48.790 --> 52:49.910
Young Master Shangjue...

52:49.910 --> 52:51.000
What happened?

52:52.500 --> 52:54.100
Why didn't you open the door?

52:56.430 --> 52:58.120
I feel a little feverish.

52:58.310 --> 52:59.770
I'm afraid I caught a cold.

53:00.350 --> 53:00.990
So,

53:01.060 --> 53:02.590
after taking the sleeping medicine,

53:02.590 --> 53:03.650
I went to bed early.

53:04.440 --> 53:06.340
I heard someone knocking on my door in my dream,

53:06.340 --> 53:07.270
so I just woke up.

53:10.350 --> 53:11.550
Sorry for intruding.

53:45.080 --> 53:45.950
You light such a

53:46.470 --> 53:48.530
heavy incense when you're sleeping?

53:48.990 --> 53:50.590
I have insomnia recently.

53:50.880 --> 53:51.970
So I put

53:52.310 --> 53:53.510
a little more spices.

54:37.830 --> 54:38.650
You're smart.

54:40.120 --> 54:42.580
You know I'm sensitive to the smell of blood,

54:42.710 --> 54:45.240
so you deliberately lit such strong incense.

54:46.870 --> 54:47.850
Unfortunately,

54:49.020 --> 54:50.420
there was one small flaw.

54:51.550 --> 54:52.170
Sir,

54:53.590 --> 54:56.190
I don't understand what you're talking about.

54:56.300 --> 54:57.270
Tell me.

54:59.270 --> 55:00.630
Whose blood is this?
